      "writtenOn": "2023-09-13T00:36:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it will make sense for non-atlas cases to just include an extra pixel of padding. I\u0027m starting to feel like shader-based clamping against undefined extra approx-fit pixel data is a can of worms. For cases where we control the filling, may as well add the extra data and keep it simple.",
